<title>POLAND: Optimus '96 group net at PLN 25.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Optimus '96 group net at PLN 25.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optimus group results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		    52.58   vs   20.35</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			45.13   vs   20.42</p>
